{"reviews":[{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-0","r":1.0,"t":"Didn't last 5 minutes","x":"I wore nails for 3 days during Wedding festivities. Each one popped off about 3 times. I even prewiped my natural nail with alcohol to remove any excess oil before applying. My 9 year old had the same problem. Not sure how this glue received so many great reviews.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-1","r":5.0,"t":"Its multipurpose","x":"I love this glue its such a SUPER GRIP!!! What I hate it its runny so don\u2019t apply too much!! I use it for my nails and my crafts!! It\u2019s so multi purpose!!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-2","r":5.0,"t":"Its multipurpose","x":"I love this glue its such a SUPER GRIP!!! What I hate it its runny so don\u2019t apply too much!! I use it for my nails and my crafts!! It\u2019s so multi purpose!!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-3","r":5.0,"t":"Strong Glue","x":"It came packaged really nicely. The glue helps my nails stay on for a long time. It's very cheap and way better than drugstore brands.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-4","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s ok but weird","x":"My daughter said that she had to poke holes in it for stuff to come out she also said that one time nothing was coming out then when glue started coming out it splattered EVERYWHERE lucky it didn\u2019t end up in her but if you know how to use glue like this then I recommend buying it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-5","r":4.0,"t":"Great Price!!!!!","x":"These were a great buy. Perfect for the price. 20 nail glues for under $15.00","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-6","r":5.0,"t":"The greatest","x":"This glue works great. I get my nails custom-made being I don\u2019t go to a salon anymore. I should be receiving my order today. It\u2019s by far the only glue that has allowed my nails to stay on. I am also extremely rough with my hands.  I\u2019m not sure why it\u2019s getting bad reviews. I can only assume they didn\u2019t it buff and prep their nails before they apply the glue. I will update this review once I receive them if I have any kind of an issue with the glue being dried out. Safe to say it is a five star g","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-7","r":4.0,"t":"Best nail glue","x":"I just received them haven\u2019t used them yet but I always use this brand so im sure they would be fine.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-8","r":5.0,"t":"In Love \u2764\ufe0f found my holy grail!","x":"Nails are on like as if I got it done at a salon. I used nail primer first before applying the fake nails and of course I buffed my nails before the primer. I love this nail glue so far nothing has fallen off day 2. I will update if they fall off in the coming days. If I don't update that means they stayed on for at least 3 weeks.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-9","r":4.0,"t":"Great glue","x":"Super fast shipping which i love but I only received 19 tubes of glue when it was supposed to be 20. I get it's just one but i paid for 20 so i should have received 20. Half of the lids had came off during transport as well, luckily the tips need to but cut in order to use.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-10","r":5.0,"t":"Best deal for a great glue","x":"BEST GLUE honestly you can't go wrong with this glue or the price it has been amazing and is quick drying I highly recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-11","r":2.0,"t":"Dried solid in bottle before opening- could not use 13 of  15 tubes","x":"Did the job well, when I used it, but sorry to say, had to throw 13 tubes in the garbage! I will try another product -will not waste $ on this again.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-12","r":4.0,"t":"One of the best","x":"This is really one of the best nail glues I've used in years dries really fast no white film left behind great just wish it didn't dry out so fast","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-13","r":5.0,"t":"Best glue ever","x":"My go to glue anytime any day. If you struggle with storage, refrigerate and thank me later.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great glue!","x":"Really good glue. Probably the best I\u2019ve used in a while. Definitely recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-15","r":5.0,"t":"SO LONG LASTING!","x":"Best glue I ever used on my clients !!! And it last long!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-16","r":5.0,"t":"ok?","x":"good except one came with no top. still useable!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-17","r":1.0,"t":"Beware don't buy","x":"I have bought this nail glue before and never had a problem with it actually loved it that's why I bought it again. But this batch that I got I don't know if they changed the formula but it smokes when it is applied and burns real bad as well. This product needs to be taken off the market or formula needs to go back to the old one. Who wants to put something like this on their natural nails with a possibility that it will catch fire","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-18","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t glue well!","x":"I just did a mani and literally 5 minutes after doing my nails, some popped off! I re-glued them again, and they popped off as well as more! Normally, my nails hold glue so good that it\u2019s hard for me to get them off! This product is a dud unfortunately and I\u2019m stuck with it because my return window closed yesterday. (The seller was fast to ship- it\u2019s just a product issue)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-19","r":5.0,"t":"Strong glue, multipurpose","x":"This glue is not only good for my wife's nails, I used it to repair my fishing rod about 5 years ago and it still is holding. Also just fixed my rifle scope reticle and it holds strong. Drugs fast and is stronger than most glues you pay more for at the store.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-20","r":5.0,"t":"it\u2019s professional buy this !! super good","x":"love it super good this is used for acrylic and this is a really good price because people buy this for around $7 for a pack of 5 but yea really recommend plus it did come like 2 week earlier then it shouldn\u2019t and that made me super excited","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-21","r":5.0,"t":"Good product. Very pleased","x":"[[VIDEOID:db7d8fd13f785024cb8eb60596c4c57]] It\u2019s definitely worth the price this glue sticks better than kiss glue for sure but other than that it\u2019s Simple. Easy to use. Does everything it\u2019s supposed to.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-22","r":4.0,"t":"Good","x":"Idk what it is but for some reason it didn\u2019t rrly hold as well as ppl say idk but for the price n the amount u get 10/10 I literally left the bottle open w out the top on by accident n it didn\u2019t dry !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-23","r":5.0,"t":"Overall really good now","x":"My first time using didn\u2019t stick very well but now its amazing and works amazing with my custom press one that I make, a lot of little bottles for a good price overall really good","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B01MZDLYG7-24","r":5.0,"t":"The best!","x":"From a non -professional, I find this to be the best and  longest lasting nail glue\u2014and I\u2019ve tried quite a few. This brand is the one you want.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the glue strong and long-lasting, holding nails on well.","cites":[4,7,9,11,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the low price and value, especially for the multi-tube packs.","cites":[4,6,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the glue is runny or dries out/solid in the bottle, making it hard to use.","cites":[2,3,12,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers experienced nails popping off quickly or poor adhesion.","cites":[1]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention packaging or quantity issues, such as missing tubes or lids coming off.","cites":[10]}]},"qa":[]}